    "name": "Complaint handling",
    "description": "A service agent logs a complaint; the CRM tier and the SLA matrix set response and resolution targets, a handler investigates under an SLA with reminders and escalation, larger compensation needs supervisor approval, and the case is resolved in the CRM.",
    "trigger_type": "webhook_received",
